Third-party software

llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023-2026 The ggml authors.
arty-engine starts llama.cpp's llama-server for every model it runs. llama.cpp is not copied into this repository;
it is downloaded separately as an official release build (the deploy used build 12110, version 0.9.0-dev, commit
cd959bae9), whose LICENSE file ships beside the binaries. The CUDA runtime libraries that build loads are
NVIDIA's and are not part of this repository.

Ollama (https://github.com/ollama/ollama), MIT License. arty-engine reads model stores written by Ollama and answers
Ollama's HTTP API; it contains no Ollama code.

The prompts and answers in tests/fixtures were recorded from Qwen3 models (Apache License 2.0) served by llama.cpp and Ollama.
No model weights are included.
